---
status: 'published';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Planning - A simple way to plan your website"
  description="Clarify outcomes, audience, scope, proof, and practical constraints. Choose the smallest effective site and what to ship first."
>
  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 md:py-28">
      <p
        class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 mb-2"
      >
        Guides
      </p>
      <h1
        class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Planning
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl">
        Plan the smallest effective website. Use the prompts below to clarify
        outcomes, audience, scope, proof, and practical choices. Then decide
        what to ship first.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How to use this + Figure (image 1 of 2) -->
  <section
    class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div
      class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start"
    >
      <div>
        <h2
          class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
        >
          How to use this
        </h2>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ol
            class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
          >
            <li>
              Answer each section in 1 to 2 lines. Keep it simple and specific.
            </li>
            <li>Pick the smallest site that clearly serves your outcome.</li>
            <li>Ship that version, then add one proof item per month.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure
        class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/guides/circle-pattern-black-white.webp"
          alt="Abstract circle pattern suggesting structure and relationships"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
        <figcaption class="sr-only">Visual: abstract structure map</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Outcomes and audience -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Outcomes and audience
      </h2>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>What is the one action a first-time visitor should take?</li>
          <li>
            Who is this for, and what do they need to trust to move forward?
          </li>
          <li>What problem are they trying to solve, in their words?</li>
          <li>
            How do people find you now (search, referrals, events, partners)?
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Decide the smallest effective site -->
  <section
    class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Decide the smallest effective site
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <article
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            One-page site
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Clear intro, who it is for, proof, next step.</li>
            <li>Fast to ship; strong for single-offer or early-stage.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">
            Ask: Is one action obvious? What proof best supports it?
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Case-study or portfolio
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Home, about or approach, 2 to 4 case studies, contact.</li>
            <li>Great for consultants, coaches, studios, and makers.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">
            Ask: Which 2 examples best show outcomes and fit?
          </p>
        </article>
        <article
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Content-led
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Home, about, articles or resources hub, contact.</li>
            <li>Works when you will publish regularly and compound trust.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">
            Ask: What cadence is sustainable for the next 90 days?
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content and proof -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Content and proof
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            What you already have
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>Client messages and common questions.</li>
            <li>Slides, proposals, posts, talks, and notes.</li>
            <li>Testimonials, outcomes, and before or after examples.</li>
            <li>Images that show real work or context.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            What to show
          </h3>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>2 to 4 short case studies with outcome and result.</li>
            <li>Testimonials with a one-line context.</li>
            <li>Logos only if they add clarity or trust.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Decorative band (image 2 of 2) -->
  <div class="relative">
    <img
      src="/images/guides/dots-blue-yellow-tws-thin.webp"
      alt=""
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
      class="w-full h-24 object-cover opacity-80 dark:opacity-70"
    />
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-stone-200/70 dark:ring-stone-800/70 pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Structure and navigation -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Structure and navigation
      </h2>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>What are the 3 to 5 core pages and in what order?</li>
          <li>What is the primary next step on each page?</li>
          <li>What do you remove to keep it focused and faster?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Editing rhythm and ownership -->
  <section
    class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Editing rhythm and ownership
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>
              How often will you update content (rarely, monthly, weekly)?
            </li>
            <li>Who will own edits and what feels natural for them?</li>
            <li>What must be easy to change without friction?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>Where will images and assets live?</li>
            <li>What is your backup or versioning approach?</li>
            <li>How will you review and publish changes?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Privacy, analytics, performance, accessibility -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Privacy, analytics, performance, accessibility
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>Any privacy constraints or tracking preferences?</li>
            <li>Do you need analytics and what decisions will it inform?</li>
            <li>What legal or compliance notes should appear?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>Are pages fast and readable by default?</li>
            <li>Is contrast, font size, and keyboard use considered?</li>
            <li>Do images have alt text where it helps meaning?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Adjacent channels and integrations -->
  <section
    class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Adjacent channels and integrations
      </h2>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>Do you need a calendar for calls or sessions?</li>
          <li>Would periodic email updates help compound trust?</li>
          <li>Any simple payments or forms needed at launch?</li>
          <li>Where else should key info stay accurate for discovery?</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Budget, timeline, and success -->
  <section class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Budget, timeline, and success
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>What is the budget and the smallest scope that fits?</li>
            <li>What is the deadline and what is truly required by then?</li>
            <li>What can wait for a follow-up release?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6"
        >
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            <li>What is your 90-day goal for the site?</li>
            <li>What indicates it is working (signals, not vanity)?</li>
            <li>What small habits will sustain it over time?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Launch and next 90 days -->
  <section
    class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-950 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        Launch and the next 90 days
      </h2>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-6">
        <ol
          class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300"
        >
          <li>
            Ship the smallest effective site. Do not wait on perfect images.
          </li>
          <li>Share it with a small circle and collect specific feedback.</li>
          <li>
            Add one proof item per month (case study, testimonial, example).
          </li>
          <li>Review analytics lightly: what do people read and click?</li>
          <li>Decide on the next smallest improvement or page.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div
        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-8"
      >
        <a
          href="/guides"
          class="inline-block bg-blue-700 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-800 transition dark:bg-blue-500 dark:hover:bg-blue-400"
        >
          Back to Guides
        </a>
        <a
          href="/guides/web-builders"
          class="inline-block border border-blue-700 text-blue-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-50 transition dark:border-blue-300 dark:text-blue-300 dark:hover:bg-blue-900/30"
        >
          Read Web Builders Guide
        </a>
        <p
          class="text-center text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 md:ml-4 mt-3 md:mt-0"
        >
          Or compare needs by type on the <a
            href="/guides#business-website-needs"
            class="text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 underline hover:no-underline"
            >Guides hub</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
